{"type": "message", "id": "e89d1217", "parentId": "e6730ebb", "timestamp": "2026-04-04T06:23:55.831Z", "message": {"role": "toolResult", "toolCallId": "functions.web_search:6", "toolName": "web_search", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\n  \"query\": \"Tesla Q2 2023 10-Q net income revenue quarterly financial results\",\n  \"provider\": \"brave\",\n  \"count\": 5,\n  \"tookMs\": 923,\n  \"externalContent\": {\n    \"untrusted\": true,\n    \"source\": \"web_search\",\n    \"provider\": \"brave\",\n    \"wrapped\": true\n  },\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"aac67dc9cbdc3af2\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nfile: tsla-ex99_1.htm\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"aac67dc9cbdc3af2\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1318605/000095017023033544/tsla-ex99_1.htm\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"128c4e70932677c2\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nS U M M A R Y H I G H L I G H T ... candidate builds Profitability 9.6% operating margin $2.4B GAAP operating income $2.7B GAAP net income <strong>$3.1B non-GAAP net income</strong>1 Q2-2023 was a record quarter on many levels with our best-ever production and deliveries and revenue approaching ...\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"128c4e70932677c2\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.sec.gov\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"3598c458aeecda83\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nTesla Releases Second Quarter 2023 Financial Results | Tesla Investor Relations\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"3598c458aeecda83\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://ir.tesla.com/press-release/tesla-releases-second-quarter-2023-financial-results\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"8ea3ec5d843052cd\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nAUSTIN, Texas, July 19, 2023 – Tesla has released its financial results for the second quarter of 2023 by posting an update on its Investor Relations website. Please visit <strong>https://ir.tesla.com</strong> to view the update.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"8ea3ec5d843052cd\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"July 19, 2023\",\n      \"siteName\": \"ir.tesla.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"01908a3e866d2418\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nTesla (TSLA) earnings Q2 2023\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"01908a3e866d2418\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.cnbc.com/2023/07/19/tesla-tsla-earnings-q2-2023.html\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"43131938307652fb\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nEarnings: 91 cents per share adjusted, versus 82 cents per share expected as per Refinitiv. Net income (GAAP) was <strong>$2.70 billion</strong>, an increase of 20% from last year. Operating income, however, was off 3% from the year-ago quarter at $2.40 billion.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"43131938307652fb\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"July 20, 2023\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.cnbc.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"1d3c79c2f18ba456\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nTesla Q2 Earnings Report Reveals 45% Profit Drop Amid Weak E.V. Sales - The New York Times\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"1d3c79c2f18ba456\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.nytimes.com/2024/07/23/business/tesla-q2-earnings-elon-musk.html\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"d77261bd269695b2\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nThe automaker said it earned <strong>$1.5 billion in the second quarter of the year on revenue of $25.5 billion. In the second quarter of 2023, Tesla made $2.7 billion and had revenue of $24.9 billion</strong>.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"d77261bd269695b2\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"July 24, 2024\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.nytimes.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"9340393aa457062b\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nTesla Q2 2023 Earnings Report: Profitable Again, Beat Expect... - moomoo Community\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"9340393aa457062b\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.moomoo.com/community/feed/110743072014342\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"c886dc16e9e20a59\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nProfit per share: ~ $0.80 to $0.87 per share Revenue: ~ $24.22 billion to $22.83 billion As you can see, Tesla beat both profit and revenue expectations. ... <strong>Net income (GAAP) was $2.70 billion</strong>, an increase of 20% from last year.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"c886dc16e9e20a59\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.moomoo.com\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"}], "details": {"query": "Tesla Q2 2023 10-Q net income revenue quarterly financial results", "provider": "brave", "count": 5, "tookMs": 923, "externalContent": {"untrusted": true, "source": "web_search", "provider": "brave", "wrapped": true}, "results": [{"title": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"aac67dc9cbdc3af2\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nfile: tsla-ex99_1.htm\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"aac67dc9cbdc3af2\">>>", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1318605/000095017023033544/tsla-ex99_1.htm", "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"128c4e70932677c2\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nS U M M A R Y H I G H L I G H T ... candidate builds Profitability 9.6% operating margin $2.4B GAAP operating income $2.7B GAAP net income <strong>$3.1B non-GAAP net income</strong>1 Q2-2023 was a record quarter on many levels with our best-ever production and deliveries and revenue approaching ...\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"128c4e70932677c2\">>>", "siteName": "www.sec.gov"}, {"title": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"3598c458aeecda83\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nTesla Releases Second Quarter 2023 Financial Results | Tesla Investor Relations\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"3598c458aeecda83\">>>", "url": "https://ir.tesla.com/press-release/tesla-releases-second-quarter-2023-financial-results", "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"8ea3ec5d843052cd\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nAUSTIN, Texas, July 19, 2023 – Tesla has released its financial results for the second quarter of 2023 by posting an update on its Investor Relations website. Please visit <strong>https://ir.tesla.com</strong> to view the update.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"8ea3ec5d843052cd\">>>", "published": "July 19, 2023", "siteName": "ir.tesla.com"}, {"title": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"01908a3e866d2418\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nTesla (TSLA) earnings Q2 2023\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"01908a3e866d2418\">>>", "url": "https://www.cnbc.com/2023/07/19/tesla-tsla-earnings-q2-2023.html", "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"43131938307652fb\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nEarnings: 91 cents per share adjusted, versus 82 cents per share expected as per Refinitiv. Net income (GAAP) was <strong>$2.70 billion</strong>, an increase of 20% from last year. Operating income, however, was off 3% from the year-ago quarter at $2.40 billion.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"43131938307652fb\">>>", "published": "July 20, 2023", "siteName": "www.cnbc.com"}, {"title": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"1d3c79c2f18ba456\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nTesla Q2 Earnings Report Reveals 45% Profit Drop Amid Weak E.V. Sales - The New York Times\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"1d3c79c2f18ba456\">>>", "url": "https://www.nytimes.com/2024/07/23/business/tesla-q2-earnings-elon-musk.html", "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"d77261bd269695b2\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nThe automaker said it earned <strong>$1.5 billion in the second quarter of the year on revenue of $25.5 billion. In the second quarter of 2023, Tesla made $2.7 billion and had revenue of $24.9 billion</strong>.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"d77261bd269695b2\">>>", "published": "July 24, 2024", "siteName": "www.nytimes.com"}, {"title": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"9340393aa457062b\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nTesla Q2 2023 Earnings Report: Profitable Again, Beat Expect... - moomoo Community\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"9340393aa457062b\">>>", "url": "https://www.moomoo.com/community/feed/110743072014342", "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"c886dc16e9e20a59\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nProfit per share: ~ $0.80 to $0.87 per share Revenue: ~ $24.22 billion to $22.83 billion As you can see, Tesla beat both profit and revenue expectations. ... <strong>Net income (GAAP) was $2.70 billion</strong>, an increase of 20% from last year.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"c886dc16e9e20a59\">>>", "siteName": "www.moomoo.com"}]}, "isError": false, "timestamp": 1775283835831}}
{"type": "message", "id": "be894485", "parentId": "e89d1217", "timestamp": "2026-04-04T06:23:55.832Z", "message": {"role": "toolResult", "toolCallId": "functions.web_search:7", "toolName": "web_search", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\n  \"query\": \"Tesla Q3 2023 10-Q net income revenue quarterly financial results\",\n  \"provider\": \"brave\",\n  \"count\": 5,\n  \"tookMs\": 917,\n  \"externalContent\": {\n    \"untrusted\": true,\n    \"source\": \"web_search\",\n    \"provider\": \"brave\",\n    \"wrapped\": true\n  },\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"be6177040ad025f8\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nTesla, Inc. (TSLA) Income Statement - Yahoo Finance\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"be6177040ad025f8\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/TSLA/financials/\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"7e5167dbacdd783b\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nGet the detailed quarterly/annual income statement for Tesla, Inc. (TSLA). Find out the revenue, expenses and profit or loss over the last fiscal year.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"7e5167dbacdd783b\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"1 day ago\",\n      \"siteName\": \"finance.yahoo.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"e0110e7ee8925fd2\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nTesla (TSLA) earnings Q3 2023\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"e0110e7ee8925fd2\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.cnbc.com/2023/10/18/tesla-tsla-earnings-q3-2023.html\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"3063b1b78a53781b\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nNet income for the quarter was <strong>$1.85 billion</strong>, or 53 cents per share, down from $3.29 billion, or 95 cents a share, a year earlier. Total gross profit declined 22% year over year. Total operating margin came in at 7.6%, down significantly from ...\\n<<<END_EXTERN