. <strong>In the second quarter of 2023, Tesla made $2.7 billion and had revenue of $24.9 billion.</strong>\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"ef0359f243cf88d5\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"July 24, 2024\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.nytimes.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"5d00491da5a1ef1b\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nTesla's Q2 2023:Accelerating into the Future with Record Revenue for NASDAQ:TSLA by financialflagship — TradingView\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"5d00491da5a1ef1b\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.tradingview.com/chart/TSLA/tAWcx7qF-Tesla-s-Q2-2023-Accelerating-into-the-Future-with-Record-Revenue/\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"414ba5c0d73297da\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nThe electric vehicle and clean energy company reported a 9.6% operating margin, GAAP operating income of $2.4 billion, <strong>GAAP net income of $2.7 billion, and non-GAAP net income of $3.1 billion</strong>.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"414ba5c0d73297da\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"July 20, 2023\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.tradingview.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"94dfd90b637c276e\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nTesla Q2 2023 Earnings Report: Profitable Again, Beat Expect... - moomoo Community\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"94dfd90b637c276e\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.moomoo.com/community/feed/110743072014342\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"dce4496346e38e73\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nProfit per share: ~ $0.80 to $0.87 per share <strong>Revenue: ~ $24.22 billion to $22.83 billion</strong> As you can see, Tesla beat both profit and revenue expectations.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"dce4496346e38e73\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.moomoo.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_